  "topography": {
    "project_purpose": "Ambire is a self-custodial Web3 wallet, primarily offered as a browser-extension wallet, that enables users to manage assets, swap, bridge, interact with dApps, and use smart-account features including EIP-7702 support for EOAs. Its WALLET token and related staking contracts are token-related components rather than the entirety of the Ambire Wallet product.",
